Full Banshee codebase

To run you need to ngrok http 8000 and update the link in twilio

run these 2 commands in inbound:
python agent_worker.py dev
uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

and these 2 in outbound:
 python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 9000
 python agent_worker.py dev

Learn more here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8knemYRetwc&t=1s
